    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshwa kūbiza ntongeeji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūfuma hanze, ūbawīla a Baisilaeli a bose ī mihayo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ī haha nalī na myaka igana na makūmi abīlī, natūdūla ū kongeja kūmutongeela. Nguno nīyo nū SEEBA waniwīlile gīkī, ‘Ū bebe yaya ū kūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūkīla hamò nang'ho, atonge ko; aje ū kū būtongi wako akūgakenaagūlaga a mahanga genaya. Hūna ū bebe ūkwīsola ī sī yabo; nū Yoshwa akūkīla hamò nang'ho kūkūtongeela gīt'ūmo SEEBA wahayīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo a banhū benabo, ū SEEBA akūbīītīla gīt'ūmo akabīītīla ba Sihoni na Ogi, a batemi ba Baamoli, abo akabakenaagūla hamò nī sī jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akūbatūūla mu makono ging'we, na lūūlū shiigelile mubīītīle gīt'ūmo naamulagīīlīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipandagi chanda mubize bashisha ng'holò, yaya ū kūbogoha a benabo, nūūlū batizūmudetemya, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīja hamò ning'we, atūmulekanīja nūūlū atūng'wība yaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūng'witana ū Yoshwa ūng'wīla mu būtongi wa Baisilaeli bose, “Ipandage chanda, hangī ūbize nshisha ng'holò, nguno shikwigeleelilwe ūje nabo a banhū benaba mushike ū mu sī īyo SEEBA wabilahīlīla bakūlūgenji babo kūbinha. Ūkūbagabanhya būlī bene bapandīke wingīji wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alītonga ko wei ng'wenekīlī, na akūbiza hamò ning'we koi; atūmuleka nūūlū atūng'wība. Yaya ū kogoha, nū kūsusanya yaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūsong'wa shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūshandīka ī shilagīlo īshi, ūbina bagabīji, a ba lūganda lwa Lawī, abo baalī babūūcha b'isandīko ly'ilagane lya ng'wa SEEBA; na a banamhala a bose a ba Baisilaeli ūbinha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Musa ūbalagīla alīhaya, “Būlī myaka mpungatī ūlū yūshika ha būkalīkījo, ū mu ng'waka gwa kūlekeja banhū būgasa wabo, ū ng'wikanza lya shigukulu sha maduku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza īlo Baisilaeli bose bakizaga kwiyoolecha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako kwipandī īlo wei ng'wenekīlī alalīsole, ūkūshisoma ī shilagīlo shenīshi ūlī kū būtongi wabo badegelekile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūbabilinga pye a banhū, bagosha, bakīma, na a banīgīnī, pyī nū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga hamò nang'ho ū mu mizengo yako; bize badegeleke, bilange kūnkūja ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, na kwīlondeela mu welwa ng'holò pyī ī mihayo ya shilagīlo shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baana babo abo batashimanile ī shilagīlo, shibigelile kūdegeleka, bilange ū kūng'ogoha ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ū mu shikū jing'we jose ī ja kwikala ū mu sī īyo mulīkīla mongo gwa Yolodani kūja kwīsola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgomi wa Baisilaeli kūhangwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, “Ī likanza lyako lya kūcha lyashikaga, na lūūlū ng'wīlage ū Yoshwa ize hamò nū bebe ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, nize nanagīle milīmo ya kwīta.” Na ng'hana ū Musa nū Yoshwa biza ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wiza a hiheema lya kwibilingīla, wiyoolecha mu nzīla ya ng'hīngī yilunde, lyīmīīla a ha nyango gwa kwingīlīla ū ng'wiheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, “Lyashikaga ī likanza lyako ū bebe ī lya kūja kwifuula na bataale bako, alīyo a banhū benaba bakwandya kwisosohaja na bamulungu bageni, ū mu sī īyo balīja kwikala. Ū nene bakūnīība, balīkenaagūle nī lilagane īlo naabeeja nabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū lūshikū lwa kwīta mhayo gūlī gīko, bakūnisayīcha no nabalekanīje gete. Nakūbibisa bayagaale, nguno ū būshū wane batūbūbona. Mihayo mingī yabūbi na ya kūbakoya īkūbagwīla. Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo bakwibūūja balīhaya, “Ī mihayo yabūbi yose yenīyī ītūūtūgwīlaga īkī ū SEEBA Mulungu wise atī hamò nise? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nene nakwibisa gete ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo; batūbūbona ū būshū bone, kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wabo bose ūbo balawīte mu nzīla ya kūbagalūkīla bamulungu bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī haha andīkaga līīlī lyīmbo lyako; ūbalange kūlyīmba a Baisilaeli, lībize būkaanīji wane kūbo kūlwa kūbakaanīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū nūbashisha ū mu sī ya būhondo ī ya kūsūlūlūka būkī na mabeele, īyo naabisagīja bakūlūgenji babo mu kwilahīla, hūna būlya bigūta būgīna, bakūbagalūkīla bamulungu bangī bandye kūbalamya banidalahe ū nene, nī lilagane lyane balīkenaagūle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī mihayo yabūbi nī ya kūbakoya ūlū yūbagwīla, ī lyīmbo lyenīlī līkūbiza būkaanīji ū kūbo; nguno lītīīwa ū mu shibyalīlwe shabo. Ū nene nīmanile īyo bakwīyideedeng'hanyaga nūūlū aho nataalī ū kūbashisha ū mu sī īyo nabisagīja mu kwilahīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Musa ūlyandīka ī lyīmbo īlī, ūbalanga a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūnkomeleja ū Yoshwa ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni alīng'wīla, “Handatīlaga na hangī ūbize nshisha ng'holò. Nguno ū bebe hū ūkūbashisha a Baisilaeli ū mu sī īyo nabisagīja mu kwilahīla, nū nene ng'wenekīlī nakūbiza hamò nang'ho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa kūbaganikīla Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa aho wamala kūyandīka mu shitabo ī mihayo ya shilagīlo shenīshi, kūfuma wandījo wayo kūshisha kū būkalīkījo wayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbalagīla a Balawī, abo babūūchaga isandīko ly'ilagane lya ng'wa SEEBA. Ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shisolagi ī shitabo īshi, ī sha shilagīlo, mushitūūle shiihele nī lisandīko ly'ilagane lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, shiikale henaho kūlwa būkaanīji kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nabūmanile ū būshitiigwa wako nū būdimu bo ntwe gwako ūmo būlī. Īkī ī haha mulī bashitiigwa gīkī alīyo hū nataalī hamò ning'we; al'ūlū nalaache, angū mmho mukūkīlanīja no a hene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ī haha babilingangi pye a banamhala ba ng'anda jing'we na a bagunanhi babo, baneegeele aha nīhayī ī mihayo yenīyī badegelekile; nabakaanīle kū būtongi wigūlū na sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno namanile hape gīkī, ūlū nūcha mukwisosohaja no mugalūke ng'wīleke ī nzīla īyo naamulagīlile. A bing'we mukūgwīlwa mayanga mataale ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi, nguno mukwīta ya malofu ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, mumpelanye kūlwa milīmo īyo mukūyūbeeja na makono ging'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
